      "text": "The source models 256x256 images as 32x32=1024 dVAE tokens (8192 vocab) jointly with BPE text (<=256 tokens) in a 12B sparse decoder-only transformer, with joint ELB (beta=6.6) and CLIP-contrastive best-of-512 rerank at inference.",
